 "remarks": "Welcome home to Norwalk's most desirable waterfront neighborhoods! This charming and vacant revitalized farmhouse is ready for you. *FIRST FLOOR 2 BEDROOM IS AVAILABLE AS WELL*, (see cross listing). Enjoy seasonal harbor views on your shared wrap around porch. Driveway parking allows 2 tandem parking spaces. The grand foyer and apartment has timeless farmhouse details throughout including beautiful original hardwood floors. Living room opens to eat-in country kitchen. Enjoy 2 Sun-filled bedrooms and bonus Office nook and updated full bath with walk in shower. Outside, relax in the lovely shared garden backyard-an ideal spot for morning coffee or unwinding after a long day. If you're looking for charm, convenience, and a walkable lifestyle near the water, this special home is a rare opportunity. Just a short walk to the SoNo Metro-North station, The SoNo Collection, waterfront parks, and the area's best restaurants, cafes, and shops. Easy commute to NYC and close to everything that makes South Norwalk one of Fairfield County's most vibrant communities. *HEAT IS INCLUDED*. Shared basement storage space and laundry",
